      "Finite algebraic compatibility is not an NS counterexample, an optimal rate claim, or an impossibility theorem for every atom method.",
      "The V time Holder mechanism and both Huang preprints were already registered; they are not newly discovered or claimed novel project results.",
      "Huang pressure local pressure-L2 condition and full-tail delayed second-order operator budget remain extra; basic first-order energy does not pay them.",
      "No external peer review, exhaustive novelty, Deep Research completion or Clay result is claimed."
